{
  "about": "Section 3.7 streak scenarios, shared by the TypeScript tests and the generated pgTAP test (supabase/tests/05_streak_cases.test.sql). Weeks start on Monday unless weekStart says otherwise. Run `pnpm gen:shared-tests` after editing.",
